        <div id="compare" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>How the Alternatives Compare With a Weslo</h2>
<p>
            The table sets the alternatives against the Cadence G 5.9, using the Weslo figures from
            our review and the Amazon listings for the rest.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[560px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr>
